WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:07.720
If we can recover the imperial seal for us it would be heaven's mercy but fortune and misfortune are intertwined.

00:07.800 --> 00:14.200
This seal is also a hot potato the longer we stay in Yiyang the more likely things will change once we get the seal.

00:14.280 --> 00:19.640
Seal the news immediately we'll claim illness and return south quickly yes.

00:20.720 --> 00:26.440
Come, come today Prince of Jin is hosting a banquet everyone gets to enjoy it too brothers come.

00:26.520 --> 00:28.520
Have a drink, have a drink.

00:36.280 --> 00:41.880
Drinking at this time gives us some benefit boosts morale don't worry about what the higher-ups think.

00:41.960 --> 00:45.280
This wine is the real deal come, come.

00:46.920 --> 00:53.267
Come, bottoms up come, bottoms up bottoms up bottoms up everyone, keep drinking I'll send some to the other brothers too.

00:57.560 --> 01:03.280
At the banquet you toast back and forth with Chu Maolun after three rounds.

01:03.360 --> 01:08.880
Chu Maolun urgently goes to relieve himself but even the soldiers guarding him disappear together.

01:09.000 --> 01:12.080
Just as you're lost in fantasies about the seal.

01:12.240 --> 01:15.680
The city gates are opened by traitors under cover of night.

01:18.000 --> 01:31.000
Due to lack of preparation, the city gates soon fell. Routed soldiers fled in disarray, and before long threw all of Yiyang into total chaos.

